  "request": "Goal: Improve AI agent config generation in senti setup and presentation of agent settings.\nScope: Allow selecting claude, codex, or both during setup; save agent.default as family alias; set agent.useProfile from selected availability and main agent; resolve built-in profiles/providers at runtime; stop normal setup/upgrade from bulk-copying built-ins; specify preservation or compaction behavior for existing seeded configs; update help/docs and tests.\nOut of Scope: Add a sample command such as senti config example agent.\nDescription: Built-in profiles/providers should remain package-managed unless users explicitly override them. Existing explicit config entries must be preserved unless a managed migration can identify them safely. Validation and runtime resolution must accept built-in profile names without requiring them to be copied into config.",
